{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://bcp.local/schemas/doudian-category-properties.schema.json",
  "title": "抖店叶子类目属性表（整份采集）",
  "description": "reports/doudian-category-properties.json 的形状。2026-09-03 从「挑 10 个字段 + options 压二元组」改为【原样保留】：此前丢掉了 rules(57% 的属性项有)、placeholder(100%，多选上限「最多选N项」就在里面)、required_tips(28%)、additions.diy_type(100%，投影判自定义值靠它)、options[].additions(58%)。\n\n数据源：抖店发布页是 schema 驱动的，没有独立的「取类目属性 / 取类目资质」接口 —— 两者都是按类目下发的发布表单 schema 的一个字段：POST /product/tproduct/getSchema → data.model.category_properties / data.model.qualification。请求体不能自己拼（服务端要求整个 context，含 149 项 gray_components），采集时取页面真实请求当模板，只替换 context.category_id（必须是字符串，传 number 会 code 10002）。\n\n由 resource/playbooks/doudian-category-schema.json 产出，与 doudian-category-tree.json 出自【同一次爬取、同一个快照】，三份共享一个 capturedAt，cid 天然对得上。\n\n**关于 payload 为 null**：先看 collection.ok。ok=true 时 null 表示抖店确实没下发这一段；ok=false 时 null 只表示【没采到】，不代表没有要求。混为一谈就会把一个「需要包装标签图」的类目当成「无要求」放行。\n\n**data 是全集**：条数恒等于叶子类目数，采集失败的类目也在里面（带 collection.ok=false + 错误原文 + 原因）。采集器写盘前断言过这一条，对不上就拒绝写文件。",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "source",
    "endpoint",
    "capturedAt",
    "stats",
    "legend",
    "failures",
    "kind",
    "data"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "source": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "endpoint": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "capturedAt": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time",
      "description": "采集时刻。同一次运行产出的三份文件此值相同 —— 这是判断三份是否同一快照的依据。"
    },
    "kind": {
      "const": "category-properties"
    },
    "stats": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "leaves",
        "ok",
        "failed"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "leaves": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "叶子类目总数。data 条数恒等于它。"
        },
        "ok": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "failed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "ok + failed 恒等于 leaves"
        },
        "crawlMs": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "totalMs": {
          "type": "integer"
        }
      }
    },
    "legend": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "description": "写给读数据的人的说明，重点是 collection.ok=false 时 payload 的 null 该怎么理解。放进数据本身而不是只放 schema 里 —— 拿到文件的人未必会来读 schema。"
    },
    "failures": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "未采集成功的类目清单，与 data 里 collection.ok=false 一一对应。2026-08-27 与 2026-09-03 两次独立采集都是同样的 39 个（38 个管制刀具类目 + 有价券）—— 抖店在下发 schema 之前先做平台准入校验，需专门资质报白，重试无用。",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "cid",
          "name",
          "err"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "cid": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "err": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "错误原文，不做归纳"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "data": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "叶子类目 id → 采集结果。条数恒等于 stats.leaves，失败的也在里面。",
      "propertyNames": {
        "pattern": "^[0-9]+$",
        "description": "叶子类目 id，字符串形式（原始 key 就是字符串，转数字会在 JS 里丢精度）"
      },
      "additionalProperties": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/entry"
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "entry": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "name",
        "path",
        "collection"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "description": "类目全路径，斜杠分隔"
        },
        "collection": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/collection"
        },
        "category_properties": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "description": "抖店下发的原样结构，**不做字段挑选**。这里只把下游确实依赖的字段写出来备查，并不限制 additionalProperties —— 形状归抖店所有，枚举死会让它加一个字段就把校验搞红。",
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "required": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "hidden": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "available": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "disabled": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "items": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "properties": {
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "label": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "显示名。**不是 name** —— 旧形状里叫 name，迁移最容易踩这里。"
                      },
                      "required": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                      },
                      "hidden": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                      },
                      "available": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                      },
                      "placeholder": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "多选属性的数量上限「最多选N项」写在这里"
                      },
                      "required_tips": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "rules": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "additionalProperties": true
                        }
                      },
                      "options": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "description": "可选值。对象数组，**不是** [value_id, value_name] 二元组。",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "additionalProperties": true,
                          "properties": {
                            "value_id": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "value_name": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "additions": {
                              "type": [
                                "object",
                                "null"
                              ],
                              "additionalProperties": true
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "additions": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "additionalProperties": true,
                        "properties": {
                          "diy_type": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          },
                          "ui_type": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "property_type": {
                            "type": [
                              "integer",
                              "string"
                            ]
                          },
                          "important_type": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          },
                          "prop_group": {
                            "type": [
                              "object",
                              "null"
                            ],
                            "additionalProperties": true
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "抖店 getSchema 的 data.model.category_properties 原样。"
        }
      }
    },
    "collection": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "ok"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "这一条是采到的还是没采到的。**读 payload 之前先读它** —— 没有这个标记，「采到了且为空」和「没采到」在数据里长得一模一样（都是 null），下游只能靠猜。",
      "properties": {
        "ok": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "error": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ok=false 时的错误原文"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ok=false 时的人话解释：为什么失败、能不能重试、要补什么"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}